		templ_7745c5c3_Err = templruntime.WriteString(templ_7745c5c3_Buffer, 1, "<main class=\"about-page\"><section class=\"about-hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">About GatsToGo</div><h1>Every kilogram and every naira, accounted for.</h1><p class=\"about-lede\">GatsToGo is the operating system for LPG plants in Nigeria. One place where customers buy gas online, staff redeem and fill orders, and owners see every sale, shift, and naira of cash as it happens.</p><figure class=\"about-banner\"><img src=\"/static/images/about/lagos-street-1200.jpg\" srcset=\"/static/images/about/lagos-street-1200.jpg 1200w, /static/images/about/lagos-street-2400.jpg 2400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1120px) 100vw, 1064px\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1000\" alt=\"Aerial view of a busy Lagos street: yellow danfo buses, kekes, and traders under umbrellas\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></figure></div></section><section class=\"mkt-section\"><div class=\"wrap about-split\"><div class=\"about-why-head\"><div class=\"mkt-section-head\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Why we exist</div><h2>Cooking gas is everyday business. Running a plant shouldn't be guesswork.</h2></div><figure class=\"about-side-photo\"><img src=\"/static/images/about/lpg-cylinders-640.jpg\" srcset=\"/static/images/about/lpg-cylinders-640.jpg 640w, /static/images/about/lpg-cylinders-1100.jpg 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1375\" alt=\"Rows of LPG cylinders waiting to be refilled\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"about-prose\"><p>Nigeria uses thousands of tonnes of LPG every day, and much of it moves through neighbourhood refilling plants. Yet at most plants the day still runs on cash, memory, and a notebook. Sales, shifts, and cash are reconciled by hand at the end of a long day, and when the numbers don't match, there's no record to check.</p><p>We built GatsToGo to make that real time: customers pay before they reach the counter, staff fill exactly what was paid for, and the owner sees it all live, from anywhere.</p><div class=\"about-stat\"><strong>4,380</strong> <span>tonnes of LPG used in Nigeria every day, on average, in December 2025.</span> <a class=\"about-source\" href=\"https://www.nigeriastartupact.ng/nigeria-lpg-supply-hits-5-2k-mt-day-in-december-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Source: NMDPRA figures, via Nigeria Startup Act</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mkt-section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"mkt-section-head\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">What we built</div><h2>Three tools, one plant.</h2></div><div class=\"about-pillars\"><div class=\"about-pillar\"><span class=\"about-pillar-label\">For customers</span><h3>A branded buy-gas page</h3><p>Your plant's own page, in your colors. Customers pay by transfer, card, or USSD and get a 4-digit code by SMS. No app, no account.</p></div><div class=\"about-pillar\"><span class=\"about-pillar-label\">For staff</span><h3>A terminal at the counter</h3><p>Cashiers and operators sign in with a PIN, redeem codes, record cash sales, and close their shift with a cash count.</p></div><div class=\"about-pillar\"><span class=\"about-pillar-label\">For owners</span><h3>A live dashboard</h3><p>Sales, gas paid for versus gas filled, cash by shift, staff, pumps, prices, and customer reviews, updated as it happens.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mkt-section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"mkt-section-head\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">What we stand for</div><h2>Principles we build by.</h2></div><div class=\"about-principles\"><div><span class=\"about-num\">01</span><h3>Your money goes straight to you</h3><p>Online payments are split by Paystack at the moment of payment. Your share settles to your own bank account. GatsToGo never holds it.</p></div><div><span class=\"about-num\">02</span><h3>Real numbers only</h3><p>Every sale, fill, shift, and cash movement is recorded as it happens, so the end of the day is a check, not a reconstruction.</p></div><div><span class=\"about-num\">03</span><h3>Built for the counter</h3><p>PINs instead of passwords, 4-digit codes instead of printouts, and screens that work on the phone or tablet already in your plant.</p></div><div><span class=\"about-num\">04</span><h3>Fair, simple pricing</h3><p>No setup fee and no monthly fee. 1.5% on online sales, nothing on cash. <a href=\"/pricing\">See pricing</a>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mkt-section\"><div class=\"wrap about-split\"><div class=\"mkt-section-head\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Trust and safety</div><h2>Serious about who sells, and how.</h2></div><ul class=\"about-trust\"><li>")
